ut imprimer une s\u00e9rie d'objets pr\u00e9d\u00e9finis, les synchroniser aux \u00e9chelles r\u00e9sidentielle et b\u00e2timent, se t\u00e9l\u00e9porter et dessiner dans l'espace en synchronisant les trac\u00e9s de la maquette avec l'objet \u00e0 plus grande \u00e9chelle.", "short_description": "Bac \u00e0 sable exp\u00e9rimental de pr\u00e9visualisation architecturale permettant d'explorer les \u00e9chelles maquette, r\u00e9sidentielle et b\u00e2timent. Inclut la synchronisation des objets et des trac\u00e9s entre les \u00e9chelles, la t\u00e9l\u00e9portation et le dessin dans l'espace."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape macromin.png", "id": "2298313643869968", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003268_2298313647203301_8247595769399624323_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e9zzUneDUcwQ7kNvwF3Ab1u&_nc_oc=AdkCryK2ZJUr1YaZSmwWU1CvWWGjmOCz9Zh1ZR7VMPyzR_97eU2mPH5ngC-aXATR2bs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvg6SGGLvlwjuvK2x1IAOMLlJcRWbzNlNsPyRoMUwc1Ug&oe=69A419E8"}, {"file_name": "macrominauta logoooo.png", "id": "1976445072777756", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75439595_1976445076111089_3974558009954605953_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B7hg6Y6ukWMQ7kNvwHYVQgN&_nc_oc=AdnxNk1lfK2w0oqzKHX-htxzAIXdrCV7l5gn0smu1R0abagd6R0I30ZJSm7dcryvw_I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs7AWgS1EQN01cKLik11QRo06oRtRNnqAoFoIptzM1x4g&oe=69A42978"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateSquare macromin.png", "id": "1667986707402771", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974632_1667986710736104_1215062973447931221_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o10lL0-mDxoQ7kNvwGC4s2e&_nc_oc=AdljuJldLoQIKisPLnCf5Pn5zBUcDGIZoTyoCeGtSEALYM0UNEboNg_HszJu8W3G4pk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3